										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><span class="_animating_6ta1u_10" data-newtext-seq="2">Choosing the best crypto wallet comes down to security architecture, supported chains, ease of use, and whether offline or online storage fits your needs. Based on these criteria, here are the top picks for 2026:</span></p>
