<td><span style="font-weight: 400;">Direct peer-to-peer trading through a platform with escrow</span></td>
<td><span style="font-weight: 400;">Private trading through brokers or liquidity desks</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span style="font-weight: 400;">Trade Size</span></td>
