										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2><b>What Is o1.exchange (O)?</b></h2>
<p><a href="https://o1.exchange/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener external noreferrer" data-wpel-link="external"><span style="font-weight: 400;">o1.exchange</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> describes itself as the &#8220;Onchain Everything Exchange.&#8221; It functions as a meta DEX aggregator, onchain trading terminal, and mobile trading interface, integrating spot trading, perpetual futures, and prediction markets into a single interface that lets users build and execute strategies across multiple assets and chains.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The project launched in 2025. According to secondary crypto-industry reporting, o1.exchange raised $4.2 million in a funding round led by Coinbase Ventures, with participation from AllianceDAO, money the project said would go toward expanding its trading terminal, deepening protocol integrations, and building out reward programs for traders.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The O token has a total supply of 1 billion tokens, with roughly 160 million currently in circulation. </span></p>
<h2><b>Trading Competition Details</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Binance Wallet is running the </span><a href="https://www.binance.com/en/support/announcement/detail/cc164ab36d114ea2a123309c9bbed74f" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener external noreferrer" data-wpel-link="external"><span style="font-weight: 400;">o1.exchange trading competition</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> on Binance Alpha. Any user eligible to trade Binance Alpha tokens can participate by trading O through </span><b>Binance Wallet (Keyless)</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> or </span><b>Binance Alpha</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><b>Detail</b></td>
<td><b>Information</b></td>
