<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rankings are based on cumulative O </span><b>purchase</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> volume during each promotion period. Sell transactions are not counted, and there is no cap on how much volume an individual participant can generate.</span></p>
<div class="b-cta-wrapper"><div class="b-cta b-cta--referral"><div class="b-cta__image"><a href="/recommends/binance/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" data-wpel-link="internal"><img decoding="async" width="300" height="300" src="https://ventureburn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/binance-logo-6219389_1280-300x300.webp" class="image-fit image-fit--center wp-post-image" alt="binance-logo-6219389_1280" /></a></div><div class="b-cta__meta"><div class="promotion"><p class="title">Binance Referral Code</p><p class="value">Get $100 USDT Sign-Up Bonus</p><p>-20% Trading Fees</p><p>Code Valid: July 2026</p></div><div class="referral-code"><input type="text" value="VB2025" class="referral-code__input" readonly><button type="button" class="referral-code__btn btn btn-primary">Copy</button></div></div><div class="b-cta__btn d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center"><a href="/recommends/binance/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="btn btn-primary" data-wpel-link="internal"><span>Claim Reward Now</span></a></div></div><!-- /.b-cta --></div>
<h3><b>Early Bird Boost Multiplier</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Binance applies a daily multiplier that decreases over the course of each seven-day promotion period, rewarding users who trade earlier. The multiplier schedule is 3.0x on Day 1, 3.0x on Day 2, 2.5x on Day 3, 2.0x on Day 4, 1.8x on Day 5, 1.3x on Day 6, and 1.0x on Day 7.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Daily Effective Trading Volume is calculated as:</span></p>
<p><b>Daily Effective Trading Volume = Actual Trading Volume × Early Bird Boost Multiplier</b></p>
<h3><b>Rising Trader Boost Multiplier</b></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Users who, as of three days before a promotion period begins, have won fewer than three previous Binance Wallet Alpha trading competitions qualify as &#8220;Rising Traders.&#8221; Eligible users receive an additional </span><b>1.2x boost</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> on their actual trading volume, subject to a Rising Trader Boost Cap set by Binance. Once a user&#8217;s cap is reached, no further Rising Trader Boost applies to their remaining volume for that period.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">When both multipliers apply, Effective Trading Volume is calculated as:</span></p>
<p><b>Effective Trading Volume = (Actual Trading Volume × Early Bird Boost Multiplier) + (min(Actual Trading Volume, Remaining Rising Trader Boost Cap) × 1.2x)</b></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Binance also noted that, effective June 17, 2025, trading volume from Alpha-to-Alpha token pairs no longer counts toward Alpha Points and is excluded from this competition&#8217;s rankings.</span></p>
<h2><b>How to Participate</b></h2>
<ol>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Click </span><b>[Join]</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> on the event page in the Binance App. Only trading volume generated </span><b>after</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> successfully joining counts toward the competition.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Update the Binance App to the latest version, and make sure a Binance Wallet (Keyless) has been created and backed up.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">During the promotion period, trade O through Binance Wallet (Keyless) or Binance Alpha.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">After the promotion period ends, rankings are calculated automatically. Eligible winners can claim rewards on the event page.</span></li>
</ol>
<h2><b>Important Conditions</b></h2>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Only trades executed via </span><b>Binance Wallet (Keyless)</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> or </span><b>Binance Alpha</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> on Binance Wallet qualify. Transactions through third-party dApps are excluded.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Token bridging transactions are not eligible for this promotion.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rewards become claimable </span><b>before 13:00 UTC on August 20, 2026</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">, and eligible users have </span><b>14 days</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> from that point to claim. Unclaimed rewards will be forfeited and not reissued.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Participants must maintain an active Binance account; tokens will not be distributed to users who delete or deactivate their Binance Wallet or Binance account.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Binance reserves the right to amend, cancel, extend, or suspend the promotion, its eligibility criteria, or the number and selection of winners at any time without prior notice.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2><b>Final Thoughts</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The o1.exchange trading competition gives eligible Binance Alpha users a way to earn O tokens through trading activity rather than a standard airdrop claim. The declining Early Bird Boost structure is designed to encourage participation early in each promotion period, while the Rising Trader Boost targets users who haven&#8217;t won multiple previous competitions.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Because Binance Alpha assets are typically low-cap and subject to significant price volatility, users should review the official terms in full and conduct their own research before participating. This article does not constitute financial advice.</span></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://ventureburn.com/binance-alpha-launches-o1-exchange-o-trading-competition-top-2160-traders-to-share-162000-o-tokens/" data-wpel-link="internal">Binance Alpha Launches o1.exchange (O) Trading Competition: Top 2,160 Traders to Share 162,000 O Tokens</a> appeared first on <a href="https://ventureburn.com" data-wpel-link="internal">Ventureburn</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
