<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The exchange also maintains its own price discovery and doesn’t just follow Binance. Because of this, &#8220;Kraken Spreads&#8221; have become popular to explain the price disparity of cryptocurrencies on Kraken compared to the global average. This makes Kraken the ideal location for traders looking for fiat-crypto arbitrage opportunities. </span></p>
